T* (There came also the soul of Odysseus having yet to make a choice, and) Tj
T* (his lot happened to be the last of them all. Now the recollection of) Tj
T* (former toils had disenchanted him of ambition, and he went about for a) Tj
T* (considerable time in search of the life of a private man who had no) Tj
